            "path": "C:\\Users\\Oron\\.codex\\generated_images\\01a0d863-8deb-7df3-b4a0-0311ad9084fd\\exec-a94e8ac3-3866-48a7-9f1a-5cce70283d0c.png",
            "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. A production-quality portrait 4:5 illustration for a warm, richly detailed travel jigsaw, painterly oil/gouache brush texture, believable materials and anatomy, no text or logos or border. Not photorealistic, no vector style, no UI. Full bleed, clear enjoyable focal point and ample varied puzzle detail. Generic imaginative place with no identifiable landmark. Clean background plate for later adding exactly five tiny painted moving details; do not draw those five listed details, but draw their anchor surfaces naturally. A small forest waterfall cascading into a deep mossy basin surrounded by cocoa-brown rocks, rich russet tree roots and dark forest soil, cozy three-quarter view. Main large surfaces cocoa brown and deep warm earth; modest ivory water and muted moss-green highlights. Natural detailed stone not a famous place. Reserve five independent detail zones: bare short reed stem at bottom-right bank, moss patch with space for one tiny fern frond lower-left, calm dark water middle-bottom for one thin ripple, bare twig on upper-left for a little leaf cluster, a little still water pocket for a floating golden leaf. Paint waterfall water itself but no ornamental sparkle objects.",
