            "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Production hand-painted game sprite atlas, genuine transparent RGBA, no backdrop, no colored glow, no labels, no visible grid. 1536x1024 landscape, invisible 3x2 grid. Exactly five unique painted objects in reading order, sixth lower-right cell empty. Each object's complete shape fits inside central 300x300 of its 512x512 cell with generous transparent gutters. Fine natural oil/gouache brush texture, warm upper-left light. No object touches cell edge. For a shady cocoa-brown woodland waterfall basin. Paint (1) a tiny cluster of three russet reeds with slender stems joined at a fine root base; (2) a small rich moss-green fern frond with pointed bare stem end; (3) a very thin and subtle ivory-gold elliptical water ripple, nearly horizontal and translucent, not a glowing crescent; (4) a small amber-green twig with three leaves and bare stem pointing downward; (5) one golden autumn leaf floating flat on water viewed at three-quarter angle, slight wet shine, no water rectangle. Natural muted forest color, not neon.",
